<title>POLAND: Kety's share split on March 21.</title>
<headline>Kety's share split on March 21.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish aluminium plant Zaklady Metali Lekkich Kety SA will carry out its four-for-one stock split on March 21, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Kety, which has 2,500,195 shares outstanding, closed on the bourse's main market on Thursday at 280 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
